-- Seed the weekday department assignments, version 7.
--
-- mass_department_weekdays is configuration: which weekday each department is
-- expected at Community Mass. The registrar's files say nothing about Mass days,
-- so the initial set is seeded here from the roster (staffmapping.txt) mapped
-- against assigned.txt, and afterwards it is edited from the admin pages.
--
-- Every staff department name the roster uses gets exactly one row, so the
-- staff snapshot (src/server/mass.ts, buildStaffSnapshot) resolves a person's
-- department straight out of staff.department with no name translation. A
-- department that is not listed here is simply never expected -- it is not an
-- error -- so a new department added by input or upload cannot break anything;
-- an administrator assigns it a weekday when the university says which one.
--
-- INSERT OR IGNORE with a deterministic id, keyed on the unique department_code,
-- so re-running this file cannot duplicate a row or overwrite a weekday an
-- administrator has since changed.

